📢 Calling All Tian Xuning Fans, ZiYu Fans  & TianZiyu Shippers! 📢

The BreakTudo Awards voting is officially OPEN! "Revenged Love" is nominated for BL Series of the Year, and we need YOUR help! ZiYu Philippines, a solo stan, is uniting with all ZiYu and Tian Xuning fanbases (including TianXiyu) for a powerful collaboration.

🤝 Join the Force! 🤝

See the amazing fanbases already on board in the picture! If you're a ZiYu or Tian Xuning fan and want to join this collaboration, send us a message! If you haven't received an invite yet, consider this your official invitation! To make it easier to share voting strategies and details, we're creating a Group Chat for all participating fans. Message us to be added!

